Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.47,0:08:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela desmaiou!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:18.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.25,0:08:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela desmaiou!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:22.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.73,0:08:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,O pulso está muito fraco.
