Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A pressão despencou!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:25.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.51,0:08:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pro hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:26.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pro hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:26.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.87,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Imediatamente pro hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:26.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.31,0:08:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
