Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.97,0:08:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:28.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.55,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Você fica do lado do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, eu cuido dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.94,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kadir, abre a porta!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:36.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.92,0:08:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou abrir, Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:37.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.82,0:08:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Abre logo essa porta, cara!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.03,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem, irmão. Kadir, abre o portão.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:43.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.62,0:08:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, o Şahin tá aqui. Kadir, abre o portão!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.56,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, é o Şahin. Kadir, abre o portão!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Abre o portão, Kadir, abre! Fecha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:54.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.41,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, dê meia-volta! O que tá acontecendo aqui, droga?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:58.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.37,0:08:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é hora pra isso, Şahin! O que vocês estão escondendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:00.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.29,0:08:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai da frente pro carro passar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai da frente pro carro passar! Quando foi que você chegou?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada. Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,O que tá acontecendo, cara? Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.41,0:09:10.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.53,0:09:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, não é nada, eu vou te explicar. Você não tava na mansão, na oração?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:12.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você tá fazendo aqui? O que aconteceu com a Alya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:15.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.01,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, eu vou te explicar, calma! Vamos embora que eu te conto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.53,0:09:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, vamos! O que vocês tão escondendo, cara?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:18.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada! O que vocês tão escondendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:22.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.87,0:09:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha que a minha paciência tá no limite, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:23.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.15,0:09:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, agora não!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:24.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.15,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui, Şahin, cara!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.35,0:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:25.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.77,0:09:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anda logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:28.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.60,0:09:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, anda, eu vou te contar! Vamos, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.09,0:09:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:30.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te explicar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:31.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.88,0:09:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde é que você vai me explicar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:32.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.91,0:09:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou contar, anda logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.86,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Como ela está?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:37.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A pressão voltou ao normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,O pulso também estabilizou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Administramos um sedativo leve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:42.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.33,0:09:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,O corpo dela entrou em estado de repouso.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.05,0:09:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso também vai ajudá-la a dormir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:46.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.71,0:09:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há com o que se preocupar, Senhor Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.13,0:09:47.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.25,0:09:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora está sob controle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:48.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado, doutor. Muito obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.45,0:09:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te avisei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:15.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos conversar depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:20.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não, não é hora disso agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.38,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Você escondeu por tanto tempo... agora me conta!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:26.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero saber de tudo, senão...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:29.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.49,0:10:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou enlouquecer, olha... eu vou pirar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.39,0:10:37.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fui visitar o túmulo do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:42.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.14,0:10:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando cheguei lá, tinha uma mulher em frente ao túmulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:45.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Corri atrás dela e perguntei: "O que está havendo?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"O que você está fazendo nesse túmulo? Quem é você?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:49.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.06,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem era?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:55.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.33,0:10:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela disse: "Quem está enterrado ali não é o Boran, é o meu marido."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:11:02.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.69,0:11:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí, investigando mais a fundo a história, aquele homem que encontramos no mercado, o Vurgun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:17.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.51,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,eu cheguei até ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me diga que ele não é o seu homem de confiança?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.86,0:11:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você nem o conhecia, então?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.53,0:11:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ele era o homem do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:30.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.78,0:11:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Exato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:32.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.20,0:11:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse: "Me conta tudo."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Me explica o que está acontecendo aqui."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:38.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,E ele contou... no dia do acidente de vocês...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:42.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.71,0:11:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,ele estava seguindo o carro de vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:45.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim que viu o acidente, correu até vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:49.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.50,0:11:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Primeiro foi ver como você estava, mas você estava desacordada.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.96,0:11:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran também estava inconsciente.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:57.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.82,0:11:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí ele pensou que fosse uma emboscada armada contra vocês.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:01.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.89,0:12:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tirou o Boran do carro e o levou para o carro dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.32,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinha outro homem com ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.52,0:12:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um cúmplice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:11.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.80,0:12:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,E esse homem... aquela mulher que eu vi no túmulo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:14.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,E daí?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:16.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,era o marido dela.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:21.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.27,0:12:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Destruíram o rosto dele para ficar irreconhecível.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:22.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele o matou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:24.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.56,0:12:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, deixa eu te contar isso depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim "matou"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:28.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos falar disso mais tarde, eu te explico depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.86,0:12:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Me diz agora! Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:32.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se levante, Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi assim que ele matou o homem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:37.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.76,0:12:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora me conta: por que você estava na empresa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:50.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.13,0:12:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, eu menti pra você.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:53.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.11,0:12:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles não me queriam na oração, e eu tive vergonha de falar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.23,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso fiquei na empresa. Foi só isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.83,0:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Não te quiseram na mansão, mas te convidaram pra ir pra empresa, é isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:59.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.09,0:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Você acha que eu sou criança?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:02.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.03,0:13:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vi quando entraram pela porta do subsolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:04.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.83,0:13:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tentei entrar também, mas não deixaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:05.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.55,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,O que tem lá embaixo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.51,0:13:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, não tem nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,De verdade, não é nada que seja da sua conta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:10.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.26,0:13:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que a Alya foi lá?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:11.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.44,0:13:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.30,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu pra ela desmaiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.44,0:13:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.16,0:13:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que eu vou saber?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A mulher passou mal e desmaiou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:16.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faço ideia, não sei de nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:16.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.12,0:13:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:17.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.96,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.78,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe e não quer me dizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:19.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.20,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.52,0:13:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso tem a ver com o que a Mine ia contar pro meu pai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:22.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, o que você tá escondendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:24.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tô escondendo nada, Şahin, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:25.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.44,0:13:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá escondendo, sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:31.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.08,0:13:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei que isso tem a ver com a gente e com o que a Mine ia falar pro meu pai! O que você tá escondendo? Fala! Abre a boca!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:33.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão escondendo da gente? Desembuchem logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:35.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.64,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês tão fazendo aqui? Saiam daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.54,0:13:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá na cara que aconteceu alguma coisa hoje à noite! Falem logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:41.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.08,0:13:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tava falando sobre o que a Dona Mine ia contar pro seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.24,0:13:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é, minha filha? Fala e se livra disso de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:47.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.54,0:13:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala, garota! Desembucha! Até quando você vai ficar calada, menina?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:49.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pai, já chega! Saiam do meu quarto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:50.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Com quem você pensa que tá gritando?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:51.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.18,0:13:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:52.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:55.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Larga ela! O que você tá fazendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu moleque!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:57.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.18,0:13:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.12,0:13:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, vê se coloca rédeas na sua mulher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.24,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel, pelo amor de Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:02.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Coloca a sua mulher no lugar dela!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:03.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.23,0:14:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fora!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.23,0:14:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:05.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.23,0:14:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:07.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.23,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ainda vou ver você virar homem de verdade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:08.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:09.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.23,0:14:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos logo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:15.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.74,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:16.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.74,0:14:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:17.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.74,0:14:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel, não faça isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:19.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.74,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.36,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:24.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.78,0:14:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não for pra me contar a verdade, nem se aproxime de mim, ouviu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:28.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.84,0:14:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu chorei tanto em frente àquele túmulo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:42.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.49,0:14:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi no túmulo de outro homem que eu chorei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:47.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.61,0:14:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi pela morte do marido de outra que eu chorei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:51.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho foi até lá, sabia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.62,0:14:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficou na frente da lápide e disse "papai"...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele chamou por "papai".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:57.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele chamou "papai", ficou ali parado...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.54,0:14:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,e chorou.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.91,0:15:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:08.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pense pelo lado positivo: o Boran está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:14.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Durante dias eu me culpei tanto, achando que tinha matado o meu marido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:17.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.47,0:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Passei semanas me corroendo por dentro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.03,0:15:20.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.15,0:15:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O peso na minha consciência me destruiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.55,0:15:22.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dona Sadakat me acusando de um lado...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:25.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.93,0:15:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,e eu me martirizando do outro, até não aguentar mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:28.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.66,0:15:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Achando que tinha deixado o meu filho sem pai...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.54,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,eu me destruí por dentro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.64,0:15:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me torturei todos os dias!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.25,0:15:34.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.37,0:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,E você sempre me culpando!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:37.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi por vontade do Boran que eu vim para cá!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:40.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.86,0:15:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi por vontade do Boran que eu me casei com você!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:40.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.28,0:15:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi pela vontade dele que me casei com você!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:50.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.50,0:15:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,E além de tudo... além de tudo nos apaixonamos... nós nos apaixonamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:03.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.57,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Não... nós nunca nos amamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:05.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.55,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Não podemos esquecer o Boran...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:06.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.58,0:16:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu soubesse...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:13.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.89,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu soubesse... se o meu marido tivesse confiado um pouco em mim e me contado as coisas...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:15.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.35,0:16:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu soubesse...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.52,0:16:18.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.64,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,nada disso teria acontecido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:21.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.01,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu teria ido embora.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:26.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu deveria ter ido embora!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:29.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.83,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu soubesse, teria partido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:31.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.73,0:16:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu deveria ter ido embora logo no primeiro dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:33.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.35,0:16:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Antes que qualquer coisa acontecesse...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:35.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.27,0:16:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu deveria ter pegado o meu filho e ido embora!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:39.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você não me deixou ir! Se tivesse deixado, nada disso teria acontecido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:42.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.71,0:16:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A vida do meu filho foi em pedaços!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:45.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.21,0:16:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A minha vida e a sua vida foram arruinadas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.83,0:16:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,E a vida do Deniz?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:49.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.35,0:16:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:51.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.65,0:16:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem vai prestar contas pelo que fizeram com a vida dele?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:53.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.10,0:16:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:54.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem vai pagar por isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:55.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.12,0:16:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:59.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.84,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Deite-se, descanse. Se acalme...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.14,0:17:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhem só para isso...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:37.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém atende aos meus telefonemas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:38.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.92,0:17:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde eles estão?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:41.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.98,0:17:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, eu já tinha avisado à senhora que eles foram para a empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:43.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Surgiu uma reunião urgente.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.14,0:17:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que era importante.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.90,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Que urgente o quê!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:47.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Que reunião num dia como hoje?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.14,0:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém trabalha num dia como o de hoje?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:52.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.62,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No aniversário de morte do meu próprio filho...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.10,0:17:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,vão ficar trabalhando?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:56.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.90,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, Dona Sadakat... Já liguei tantas vezes e ninguém atende!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:59.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Até que enfim! Onde vocês estavam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:03.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:05.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Saiam vocês, vão.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:10.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meninos, onde vocês estavam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:15.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.35,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No aniversário de morte do irmão de vocês, vocês somem do mapa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:17.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde vocês estavam? Quem trabalha hoje, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:19.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Trabalhar num dia como hoje? Vocês não têm vergonha na cara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.86,0:18:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós tínhamos que ir, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:23.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.55,0:18:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não fosse urgente, nós teríamos ido?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:28.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.01,0:18:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Que urgência o quê?! Que urgência no mundo pode ser mais valiosa que a memória do meu Boran? Onde está o Cihan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:31.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A reunião dele se estendeu, ele vai chegar tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:38.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.70,0:18:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, vai chegar tarde! E a Dona Alya também não está, sumiu do mapa, foi embora! Onde ela está?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.81,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está de plantão, mãe. No hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:42.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.94,0:18:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conseguiu folga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:42.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.17,0:18:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conseguiu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:51.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.03,0:18:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer que ela não está nem aí! Jogamos a terra sobre o meu Boran, e ela simplesmente o esqueceu! Mas eu não esqueci!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:56.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.11,0:18:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Todas as noites eu me deito sentindo o cheiro do meu Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:03.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.10,0:19:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,É com o cheiro e com a saudade dele que eu acordo todo santo dia! Eu não esqueci!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não me esqueci do Boran, mas vocês se esqueceram!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:10.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.69,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, chega. Pelo amor de Deus, já chega, olha...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:15.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.16,0:19:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhem só pra ele, ainda querendo me dar lição de moral!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:21.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.27,0:19:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não teve nenhum respeito pela memória do seu irmão, deu as costas e foi embora no meio da oração!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,E ainda quer me ensinar boas maneiras, me mandando parar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:29.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.85,0:19:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lá embaixo, diante de tanta gente, diante de todos aqueles convidados...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.95,0:19:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,na frente da família da moça...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:32.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.24,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,você me fez passar vergonha, senhor Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Você me humilhou, me envergonhou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele casamento vai acontecer, ouviu bem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:38.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.25,0:19:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele casamento vai acontecer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:41.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.61,0:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, vai acontecer, aquele casamento vai acontecer...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,mas não agora, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:46.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.53,0:19:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é o momento pra isso, mãe, de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.99,0:19:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim não é o momento? Quando vai ser o momento então...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.10,0:19:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:52.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.96,0:19:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A moça está arrasada e a família dela está furiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:55.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu liguei e falei com eles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.07,0:19:56.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanhã eles virão aqui na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:59.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.91,0:19:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos sentar cara a cara e conversar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.73,0:20:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,E você vai consertar essa situação, senhor Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.73,0:20:03.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.85,0:20:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.40,0:20:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite pra senhora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:15.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.27,0:20:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:19.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.25,0:20:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem dera eu não te amasse tanto...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:52.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.79,0:20:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é o meu maior desespero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:00.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,É a minha maior incerteza...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:06.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.44,0:21:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá, qual de vocês vai falar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:41.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.33,0:21:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês estão olhando para a minha cara como se tivessem visto assombração!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:44.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.91,0:21:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, me digam o que aconteceu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:44.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.01,0:21:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:47.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, você nem tocou na comida!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:49.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.18,0:21:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Conta outra, que essa não cola!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:53.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.80,0:21:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você nem sequer tocou no prato, é porque tem uma tragédia enorme caindo sobre nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:54.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.88,0:21:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:55.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.46,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Como não é nada? Tem alguma coisa sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:58.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.87,0:21:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu tô dizendo que não é nada, é porque não é nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:04.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.13,0:22:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Faz horas que a Dona Alya não liga pro Cihan! Mesmo de plantão, ela teria ligado cem vezes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:06.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.49,0:22:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas ela não ligou! Olha que horas são... Me diz que horas são!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.79,0:22:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A essa hora ela ainda não apareceu por aqui, você ouviu bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:11.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.83,0:22:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem alguma coisa muito grave acontecendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.11,0:22:14.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.23,0:22:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Que coisa grave é essa, Ümmü? O que é que tem de tão grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:18.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.77,0:22:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, não é nada. É só a tagarelice de sempre da Ümmü.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:25.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.00,0:22:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,É o quê? Tagarelice? Onde está o Cihan? Ele não voltou ontem à noite?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:33.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.82,0:22:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele veio. Mas saiu bem cedo, tinha trabalho na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.60,0:22:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse para nós não irmos. Foi sozinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.63,0:22:37.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.75,0:22:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele disse: "Fiquem aqui na mansão".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:39.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.51,0:22:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Saiu cedo... Saiu cedo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:42.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.35,0:22:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi sozinho... Você viu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:46.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.94,0:22:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não. Tenham um bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:51.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.21,0:22:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado. Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:52.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.37,0:22:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus abençoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:54.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.05,0:22:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu só?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:55.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.25,0:22:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está mentindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.09,0:22:57.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.21,0:22:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você tá inventando? Ele nem sequer dormiu aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:22:59.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.83,0:22:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:00.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.37,0:23:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tenho razão?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:11.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.76,0:23:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia. Onde está o Şahin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.69,0:23:47.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.81,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora você pergunta do seu marido para mim?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.05,0:23:53.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.17,0:23:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está na mansão? Para onde ele saiu a essa hora da manhã?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:23.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.84,0:24:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom, é o Şahin, afinal de contas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.43,0:24:43.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:41.55,0:24:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin? O que esse desgraçado tá fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:45.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.04,0:24:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin! Şahin! Şahin! Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:48.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.18,0:24:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, o que você tá fazendo, cara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.91,0:25:00.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:59.03,0:25:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde você pensa que vai? Não se aproximem!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.19,0:25:01.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:01.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:00.85,0:25:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Saíam da minha frente, droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:02.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.33,0:25:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá fazendo uma loucura!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.83,0:25:03.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.95,0:25:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá fazendo uma loucura, cara, para com isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.01,0:25:04.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:03.13,0:25:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquem longe, droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:05.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:04.32,0:25:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai da frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.95,0:25:06.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.07,0:25:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.40,0:25:06.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.52,0:25:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.28,0:25:07.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:06.40,0:25:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.65,0:25:08.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.77,0:25:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquem longe, caramba!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.49,0:25:09.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.61,0:25:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada lá dentro, o que você tá fazendo?!
