Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.14,0:37:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.97,0:37:43.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:41.09,0:37:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não vai morrer...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:49.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.21,0:37:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus... Louvado seja Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.98,0:38:19.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:15.10,0:38:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tinha que descobrir pelo Şahin que o Boran estava vivo?!
